284	     * refused (403) when the user who opened it tries to settle it, and refused (422) settling a
285	     * claim above the proof threshold with no proofs. A clerk settling one whose
286	     * figure is above the sheet's clerk limit makes it PENDING instead.
287	     */
288	    @Transactional
289	    public Claim changeStatus(String sheetId, String user, long id, ClaimStatus next) {
